  rollback to savepoint a;
  -- POSITIVE EXAMPLE: custom roles are members of the API roles
  create role lint_report_role;
  create role lint_login_role login;
  grant authenticated to lint_report_role;
  grant anon, authenticated to lint_login_role;
  select name, detail, cache_key from lint."0032_custom_role_inherits_api_role";  -- expect 3 rows
             name              |                                                                    detail                                                                    |                          cache_key                           
-------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------
 custom_role_inherits_api_role | Role `lint_login_role` is a member of `anon` and inherits all of its privileges. Revoke the membership unless this is intentional.           | custom_role_inherits_api_role_lint_login_role_anon
 custom_role_inherits_api_role | Role `lint_login_role` is a member of `authenticated` and inherits all of its privileges. Revoke the membership unless this is intentional.  | custom_role_inherits_api_role_lint_login_role_authenticated
 custom_role_inherits_api_role | Role `lint_report_role` is a member of `authenticated` and inherits all of its privileges. Revoke the membership unless this is intentional. | custom_role_inherits_api_role_lint_report_role_authenticated
(3 rows)

